        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu yesi naba niyoonoona olwa ahulila omulango kwokhwitsuba akobuloli, naye nali omuloli, kata owalola netsimoni kata owamanyibwa, ne nararumbula ta, kho yeetuushe obumayaanubwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata omundu naba natiilakhwo khushiomusilo kwosi, kata nishili eshirundu shieisolo eyomusilo, kata eshirundu shiomuruko kwomusilo, kata eshirundu shiebindu ebimoola hasi biomusilo, ne nikamwibisila, naba mwibilu, kho aba neshiuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata naba natiilakhwo khumusilo kweshinamundu, kata obukaali bwosi bwosi obuchila naba mwibilu, nikamwibisila; olwa amanya kho aba neshiuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata omundu naba niyeetsuba nomunwa matetekhana okhukhola obubii kata okhukhola obulayi, likhuwa liosi liosi elia omundu aboola matetekhana khushiitsubo, ne nilimwibisila; olwa amanya, kho aba neshiuku mwikhuwa elala khukano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa aba nali neshiuku mwikhuwa liosi eliokhu ako, yeeyame eliene elia yoonooneele; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mana yeetse ewOMWAMI nomusangokwe kweshiuku khulwa eshionoono eshia yoonoonile, mbu eshikhasi eshiomubiayo, kata likondi kata imbusi, khulwa omusango kwobwonooni; ne omukuhani amutise khukeshionoonoshie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne naba nali omumanani ouranyala likondi ta, yeetse ewOMWAMI nomusangokwe kweshiuku khulwako aka yoonoonile, mbu amahuusi kabili kata emisosole chibili chiamakuuku; elala libe omusango kwobwonooni, ne elindi libe omusango omusambe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeetse ninako ewomukuhani, naye aranjilile aleere lienelo elili liomusango kwobwonooni, aborole likosi nafwonola omurwe, oburaliarasilia elala ta; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mana yoohe akandi khumalasile komusango kwobwonooni khulubeka Iweshimalilo; nako amalasile akatong'a karaatsile hasi weshimalilo; nomusango kwobwonooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana aleere eliakhabili libe omusango omusambe, eshiima eshialakwa shinga olwa shili; kho omukuhani amutise khukeshionoonoshie eshia yoonoonile, naye alaleshelwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne naba nali omumanani ouranyala amahuusi kabili kata emisosole chibili chiamakuuku ta, yeetse neshihaanwashie khulwako aka yoonoonile, mbu eshitonye shielikhumi shia efa ndala yobusie obunyushe khulwa omusango kwobwonooni; aleshe okhurakhwo amafura, kata okhurakhwo obubaane ta; okhuba nomusango kwobwonooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeetse ninabwo ewomukuhani, naye omukuhani afumbarekhwo obulaba eshiitsulilo shiabwo, nabusambila khushimalilo, khubihaanwa biOMWAMI ebikholelwa omulilo; nomusango kwobwonooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho omukuhani amutise khushionoonoshie eshia yoonoonile mwikhuwa liosi khukano, naye alaleshelwa; nabwo obutong'a bube bwomukuhani, shinga omusango kweimele olwa kubeele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.5.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Emisango chieshiuku",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
